*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PAY0012
*> PURPOSE : PAYROLL DEDUCTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-05-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 337
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PAYNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0012.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PAY0012C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> BENEFITS ELIGIBLE Y/N
    05 WS-BEN             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> PENSION CONTRIBUTION RATE
    05 P-CR               PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 4000-BENEFITS
    PERFORM SET-PENSION
    DISPLAY "WS-BEN=" WS-BEN
    DISPLAY "P-CR=" P-CR
    STOP RUN.
4000-BENEFITS.
    IF CU-WS-ETYP = 'F'
       OR (CU-WS-ETYP = 'P' AND CU-WS-HRS >= 25)
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-BEN
    END-IF.
SET-PENSION.
    IF CU-P-EN = 'Y'
       AND CU-YS-YY >= 3
        MOVE 0.0600 TO P-CR
    ELSE
        MOVE 0.0200 TO P-CR
    END-IF.
